    <comment>- update to 0.0.27:
  * Add support for Python 3.14. PR #1578 by @svlandeg.
- update to 0.0.26:
  * Fix attribute handling in `model_dump` for compatibility
    with the latest Pydantic versions. PR #1595 by @spazm.</comment>
