    <version>0.0.37</version>
    <time>1774888272</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- update to 0.0.37:
  * Drop support for Python 3.9. PR #1766 by @tiangolo.
  * Add script to remove Python 3.9 files, migrate to Python
    3.10.
  * Bump prek from 0.3.2 to 0.3.3.
  * Bump typer from 0.23.1 to 0.23.2.</comment>
    <requestid>1343512</requestid>
  </revision>
  <revision rev="8" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>a80c0018fee879691f682d0dd30e3bb0</srcmd5>
    <version>0.0.38</version>
    <time>1777230695</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- update to 0.0.38:
  * Fix type annotation in `SQLModel.__new__`, avoid explicitly
    returning `Any`.
  * Fix `tuple_` return type annotation.
  * Fix typos in `contributing.md`. PR #1842 by @GopalGB.
  * Remove outdated Python 3.9 tutorial file.
  * Fix ambiguous phrasing regarding `HeroPublicWithTeam`
    model.
  * Handle external links `target=_blank` and CSS automatically
    in JS and CSS.
  * Document `.in_()` method. PR #619 by @masylum.
  * Fix small typos in the documentation. PR #1641</comment>
    <requestid>1349299</requestid>
  </revision>
